# Declare an API and participant

`contract.trellis` is the source of truth for both the public API and the participant that implements it.

```trellis
api "acme.orders@v1" {
  version "1.0.0";
  display_name "Orders";
  description "Order management API.";

  model CreateOrderRequest {
    customerId: string;
  }

  model CreateOrderResponse {
    orderId: string;
  }

  rpc "Orders.Create" {
    version "v1";
    input CreateOrderRequest;
    output CreateOrderResponse;
  }
}

participant "acme.orders-service@v1" service {
  implements "acme.orders@v1";
}
```

Run `trellis generate`. The canonical `trellis.api.v1` and `trellis.participant.v1` artifacts are emitted before language SDKs are replaced.
